  "claims_review": [
    "APP017 is a tested core/source development milestone. All 271 tests in 42 suites passed with 267 application source entries identical before and after testing and matching the immutable source snapshot.",
    "The focused gain run records linking Rebase; the later full-suite invocation completed an incremental build. The debug executable copied after testing is a separately timestamped observation, not a test-time executable identity.",
    "APP015/Rebase 0.15.0 remains the latest accepted packaged GUI checkpoint. The live packaged executable still matches its accepted SHA256 65d0704e0897752c235d48e66ce96443f9f4b0a6c9366916efa5be2796d2fd41; no new GUI release is claimed.",
    "Supplied accessor gain is mutable without resetting retained conversion state. Gain precedes upsampling and follows source-format downsampling and conditional PCM24 quantization. Equal-rate PCM24 magnitude >= 2^-95 or signed zero is an explicit application admission bound, not a native rejection rule.",
    "Production timeline playback still constructs unity equal-rate accessors and applies event/segment gain separately. Nonunity accessor gain and differing-rate placed timeline playback are not silently promoted into that path.",
    "Six new tests compare 48 retained-state reads and 16,540 predicted Float32 words. The 3,168 equal-PCM24 vectors, 709 below-bound discriminators and 96 stage-order vectors are analytical controls; 67 discriminate stage order and 66 discriminate omitted quantization. Standalone optimized and UBSan controls each pass 117,593 assertions.",
    "Mode1 expectations share host libm primitives and mode2 expectations share the pinned public SoXR backend. Their wrapper/state expectations are independent; they are not Cubase runtime sample comparisons.",
    "Fresh grouped processing conforms member accessors to the first collected reference stream, not automatically the originally requested event or project rate. Reader multiplier, selected stream and engine rate owners remain distinct, and full rate reconciliation is unresolved.",
    "Proprietary executions and Cubase runtime comparisons remain zero. Complete Cubase product fidelity, hosted callback behavior and ordinary full-project playback remain unestablished."
  ],
